<%- include('dash-header') %><a class="dash-back" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs') %>">← All background work</a><div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="overline">LET THE WORK CARRY ON</p><h1>A little time.<br>A bigger possibility.</h1><p class="heading-description">Research, compare, draft, or explore. Tell Brain what a useful result would look like.</p></div></div><section class="dash-panel compose-panel"><% if(error) { %><p role="alert" class="message error"><%= error %></p><% } %><% if(!aiReady) { %><div class="dash-notice warning">Background thinking is not available yet. Your memory still works.</div><% } %><form method="post" action="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs') %>" class="compose-form" data-pending-label="Starting…"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><label for="task">What would you like to move forward?</label><textarea id="task" name="task" rows="8" maxlength="32000" placeholder="What are you trying to accomplish? Include the context, constraints, and what you’d like back." required><%= task %></textarea><label for="delivery">Where should the result go?</label><select id="delivery" name="deliver"><option value="brain" <%- deliver==='brain'?'selected':'' %>>Save in my brain</option><option value="brain+email" <%- deliver==='brain+email'?'selected':'' %>>My brain + email, when available</option></select><p class="compose-hint">Results are saved here and shared with your assistants. Email is used only when delivery is available.</p><div class="compose-actions"><button type="submit" class="dash-button lime" <%- !aiReady?'disabled':'' %>>Start background work ↗</button><a class="dash-button outline" href="<%= brainLink('/dashboard/jobs') %>">Cancel</a></div></form></section><%- include('dash-footer') %>
